    "tier": 1,
    "type": "standard",
    "notes": "<h3 data-section-id=\"mb5v8a\" data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"665\">Personality</h3><p data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"944\">Nyla enjoys making people underestimate her. She speaks softly, smiles rarely, and notices everything. She isn't cruel, but she finds human behavior fascinating in the same way a scientist studies insects. Unlike Jax, she genuinely enjoys the game of deception and infiltration.</p><h3 data-section-id=\"1r0j58p\" data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"962\">Scene Detail</h3><p data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1103\">Always seems to appear where nobody expected her to be. Characters often realize she's been listening for several minutes before she speaks.</p><h3 data-section-id=\"emdch2\" data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1120\">Catchphrase</h3><blockquote data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1167\"><p data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1167\">\"You'd be amazed what people stop noticing.\"</p></blockquote><h3 data-section-id=\"ie5x6g\" data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1179\">Accent</h3><p data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1252\">Standard American accent with traces of California corporate upbringing.</p>",
